# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# STRICT ALLOW-LIST: ignore EVERYTHING, then re-include only what the image needs.
# This guarantees that NONE of the following can ever enter the build context / image:
#   - AI / editor tooling and local config (memory, plans, skills, notes)
#   - Internal docs:     docs/ (BUILD-PLAN, HACKATHON, DEVPOST drafts, design notes), _STATUS.md
#   - Secrets/env:       .env, .env.*, *.key, *.pem, credentials, secrets
#   - Plans / notes:     TODO.md, NOTES.md, any *.md
#   - Test/dev cruft:    tests/, demo/, screenshots/, *.png, .venv/, .git/
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*

# Re-include ONLY the files required to build and run the API:
!pyproject.toml
!src
!deploy

# Re-exclude junk that may live inside the allowed dirs:
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
